This contradicts four statements:
- docs/phase8_semantic_contract.md:166-167 ('applicability from actual objects/assertions, not a model opt-out flag');
- the phase8_pipeline.py:343 docstring ('never accept model opt-outs');
- docs/phase10_operational_contract.md:40 ('fake N/A flags block');
- the 'host checks ... exactly these rules' claim in the R1 host contract (phase8_pipeline.py:117-119).
